# Immersive UI — mandatory for [ i ] product surfaces

Read **`MASTER_BRAIN/CANONICAL/IMMERSIVE_UI_DESIGN_LAW.md`** before any UI/UX work.

## Visual target (Picture 2)

- Full-bleed media, glass floating buttons, 5-tab white bottom dock
- Timer line + coin pill top; Out-Profile bottom-left
- **NOT** the fintech dashboard shell (grey cards, “Attention Wallet” page header, ACOIN/ICOIN grid, SourceEvidence footers)

## Do not add

- `AppShell` titlebar on immersive routes
- `SourceEvidence` on default product screens
- Card-list feed as home without immersive path
- Neumorphic heavy shadows as default button style

## Do use

- `ImmersiveFeedScreen`, `gesture-buttons.css`, `iapp_immersive_feed.html` patterns
- Glass: `rgba(7,7,9,0.45)`, `backdrop-filter: blur(10px)`, thin white borders

## Default route

Product entry → **`immersive-feed`**, not card `feed` or wallet dashboard.

## Presenter exception

`appMode === 'presenter'` may use legacy linear demo screens; still prefer glass when touching feed/watch.
